      "text": "Ammon2 goes to land of Ishmael, Alma 17:19. Lamoni king over land of Ishmael, Alma 17:21 (20:14–15). synagogues built and word preached in land of Ishmael, Alma 21:20–21. Ammon2 and Lamoni return to land of Ishmael, Alma 22:4. Ammon2 called by the Spirit to teach people in land of Ishmael, Alma 22:4. converted Lamanites in land of Ishmael lay down arms, Alma 23:7–9. council held in land of Ishmael to plan defense against Lamanites, Alma 24:5. other Lamanites join people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi in land of Ishmael, Alma 25:13.",
